gez(){return"Podcasts AM, herkese a\xe7\u0131k podcast ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131 i\xe7in bir oynat\u0131c\u0131d\u0131r. B\xf6l\xfcmlerin kendisi, podcast yap\u0131mc\u0131lar\u0131nda kal\u0131r.\n\nListeler ve arama, Apple'\u0131n herkese a\xe7\u0131k aray\xfczlerinden gelir: Apple Podcasts'in en iyi programlar RSS ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 ile iTunes Arama ve Sorgulama API'si. Taray\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n liste ak\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 do\u011frudan okumas\u0131na izin verilmedi\u011fi i\xe7in amapps.app, bu ak\u0131\u015f\u0131n de\u011fi\u015ftirilmemi\u015f ve her g\xfcn g\xfcncellenen bir kopyas\u0131n\u0131 tutar.\n\nB\xf6l\xfcmler, adresi bu sorgudan gelen podcast'in kendi RSS ak\u0131\u015f\u0131ndan okunur. Ses, yay\u0131nc\u0131n\u0131n bu ak\u0131\u015fa yazd\u0131\u011f\u0131 adresten de\u011fi\u015ftirilmeden oynat\u0131l\u0131r. Baz\u0131 podcast yap\u0131mc\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131n sunucular\u0131, taray\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131n\u0131 okumas\u0131na izin vermez; bu programlar yaln\u0131zca uygulamada a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r.\n\nSe\xe7ili programlar i\xe7in ek i\xe7erik, amapps.app adresinden gelir: k\u0131sa AI \xf6zetleri, ana noktalar, konu ba\u015fl\u0131klar\u0131 ve b\xf6l\xfcm notlar\u0131. Bu dosyalar, bar\u0131nd\u0131rma sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131nda (Cloudflare, GitHub Pages) tutulur.\n\nAboneliklerin ve dinleme ilerlemen yaln\u0131zca bu taray\u0131c\u0131da saklan\u0131r.\n\nT\xfcm g\xf6rseller, ba\u015fl\u0131klar ve a\xe7\u0131klamalar podcast'lere ve Apple'a aittir."},
